         <t:div type="edition" xml:id="div2LIT1605Histor">
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:lang="gez">
               <t:ab>
                  ስምዑ፡ አኀዊነ፡ ንዜንወክሙ፡ ዜና፡ ሐዲዘ፡ ዜናሆሙ፡ ለብፁዓን፡ ቅዱሳን፡ ጻድቃን፡ ዘኮኑ፡ በመዋዕለ፡ ኤርምያስ፡ ነቢይ፡  
                  <t:gap reason="omitted"/> ወነግሠ፡ ፩ንጉሥ፡ ዘስሙ፡ ሴዴቅያስ፡
               </t:ab>
            </t:div>
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit" xml:lang="gez">
               <t:ab>
                  ወአንበረ፡ ውስተ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡ ዮሐንስ፡ መጥምቅ። ስብሐት፡ ለአብ፡ <t:gap reason="omitted"/> ዘከሠተ፡ ሎሙ፡ ምሥጢራተ፡ 
                  <t:gap reason="omitted"/> እምርስሐተ፡ ዝንቱ፡ ዓለም፡ ኀላፊ፡ በምሕረተ፡ <t:gap reason="omitted"/>
               </t:ab>
            </t:div>
            <t:note>The following division into textparts is based on <t:bibl>
                  <t:ptr target="bm:Brankaer2016VersionEthiopienne"/>
               </t:bibl>.</t:note>
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="part" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Part1">
               <t:label>History of the Blessed at the time of Jeremiah</t:label>
            </t:div>
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="part" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Part2">
               <t:label>
                  <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1666Alexande">Alexander the Great</t:persName> discovers the Island of the Blessed</t:label>
            </t:div>
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="part" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Part3">
               <t:label>The monk Gerasimas is lead to the Island of the Blessed after having read about it in a History of Alexander</t:label>
            </t:div>
         </t:div>
      </t:body>
